Z||000002||isthiswhereiputausername?||06-01-2001||11:22 PM||||10 years for me..  had her since I was 18..  been searching for one and finally found my baby  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>Had her stored away in the back of a garage the past 3 years though.. Job didnt give me much time to take her out of storage.. Making time for it this summer though!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <P>Had her for the first drive in 3 years a few weeks ago.    I sure missed driving her!<P>Will be moving down to Wichita next fall though.. Not sure if I will make her take the long trip..   My cousin is wanting me to sell her to him.. Might part with her and get another when I get there..  not sure yet though  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>||||reg||1
