Z||000018||TRiAD||06-02-2001||11:14 AM||||Well, I guess I'll chime in here, too. <BR>I don't have a Fiero now, nor have I ever owned one. <BR>I have found one that I am in the process of trying to buy, though. <BR>I am very particular, and decided I HAD to have an '88 5sp GT. Not just ANY '88 5sp GT, but a WHITE one...with WHITE trim, and black wheels, and grey interior, and low miles, and excellent condition...and ALL STOCK! Hehehe, did I say I was particular? Oh, under $4K, too. <P>So, I think I found the car. No, I KNOW I found the car. And I'm doing what it takes to try to buy her...soon!<P>Wish me luck!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR><B><I>Looking for a white '88 GT 5 sp...<BR>...Could it be...Found?<BR>Stay tuned!</I></B>||||reg||6
